    "detailed_description": "<h1>LOOK HERE!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Meet the continuation of the hardcore platformer Project: R.E.B.O.O.T!<br>You have to play for the intelligent robot, created by the best scientists for the annual tournament &quot;Project: R.E.B.O.O.T&quot;.<br>The best minds from all the planets are programming their robots each year, which must pass 30 challenging levels, equipped with deadly traps and various obstacles.<br>In the game you expect sea hardcore and fun, as well as new, unique locations and a variety of levels.<br>Also do not forget that your main goal to reach the end and prove to everyone that you are the best!",
